{"content":[{"c":["SHELOMITH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Dibri’s daughter and the mother of a man from Dan’s tribe who blasphemed the Lord’s name, for which he was subsequently stoned to death (",{"href":"?bref=Lev.24.11-16","r":"Lev.24.11-16","rawR":"Lev.24.11-16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.24.11-16","value":"Lev.24.11-16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lv 24:11-16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Sister of Meshullam and Hananiah, all of whom were descendants of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.19","r":"1Chr.3.19","rawR":"1Chr.3.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.19","value":"1Chr.3.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. KJV spelling of Shelomoth, Shimei’s son, in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.23.9","r":"1Chr.23.9","rawR":"1Chr.23.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.23.9","value":"1Chr.23.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 23:9"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Shelomoth_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Shelomoth_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Shelomoth_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Shelomoth #1"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Alternate spelling of Shelomoth, Izhar’s son, in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.23.18","r":"1Chr.23.18","rawR":"1Chr.23.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.23.18","value":"1Chr.23.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 23:18"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Shelomoth_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Shelomoth_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Shelomoth_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Shelomoth #2"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. KJV spelling of Shelomoth, Zicri’s son, in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.25-28","r":"1Chr.26.25-28","rawR":"1Chr.26.25-28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.25-28","value":"1Chr.26.25-28"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 26:25-28"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Shelomoth_Article_TyndaleOpe